WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.519
This is the home of a Popkin: everything in it, at a glance.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.546
The header shows the emoji and name, four avatars with a count, and fourteen

00:00:12.546 --> 00:00:13.325
members.

00:00:13.525 --> 00:00:17.565
For a Popkin with an end date: the time left, and when it wraps up.

00:00:17.765 --> 00:00:20.960
Group call is in the Popkin's colour, beside Invite.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.084
The Chat card shows the three latest messages, with sender, time and one line each,

00:00:27.084 --> 00:00:28.670
and how many are new.

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:33.416
When a message arrives, the count rises on the card and on the Chat tab, without

00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:34.284
reloading.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:39.680
Photos shows the count, the latest as thumbnails, and See all.

00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:44.633
Experiences shows the highest rated, with its score and number of ratings.

00:00:44.833 --> 00:00:49.112
Members lists the Host first, labelled Host, and marks which one is you.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.154
A new Popkin is never a blank page. Each section says what it is for, and offers its

00:00:55.154 --> 00:00:56.252
first action.

00:00:56.452 --> 00:00:57.961
It's just you so far.

00:00:58.161 --> 00:00:59.494
No photos yet.

00:00:59.694 --> 00:01:01.074
Nothing shared yet.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:06.980
If one section fails to load, it says so, with Try again. The rest of the Popkin is

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:07.580
fine.

00:01:07.780 --> 00:01:10.036
Try again, and the photos are back.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:16.218
Invite opens Bring someone in: the QR code and the invite link.

00:01:16.418 --> 00:01:19.378
Copy invite link, and the button reads Copied.

00:01:19.578 --> 00:01:22.333
A sheet on a phone, centred on a wider screen.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.255
On a phone, the home is one column.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:31.178
From a tablet, the tabs are a rail.

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:37.169
On a laptop, a sidebar names the Popkin, with its members and the time left, and the

00:01:37.169 --> 00:01:39.007
home goes to two columns.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:42.680
Wider still, the same home, with more room.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:49.020
A wider screen shows more: a fourth message, three experiences, six members.

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:51.872
And every screen works in light and in dark.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:58.601
What no screen shows, the tests prove: only a member reads the home, and the time

00:01:58.601 --> 00:01:59.924
left keeps moving.

00:02:00.124 --> 00:02:03.746
The album, experiences and the call come in later journeys.

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:08.539
That is journey four. Popkin is a free platform for pop-up communities.
